* CABSRT15 - CONTROL FILE CONSOLIDATION FOR THE BALANCING REPORT
* THE CONTROL FILE IS WRITTEN WITH DISP MOD, SO EVERY ATTEMPT AT
* EVERY PROCESS IS ON IT INCLUDING THE ONES THAT WERE RERUN.
* THIS SORT KEEPS THE LAST RECORD FOR EACH PROCESS AND DISCARDS
* THE EARLIER ONES.
*
* THE EQUALS OPTION IS WHAT MAKES THAT WORK - IT PRESERVES INPUT
* ORDER WITHIN EQUAL KEYS AND THE E35 EXIT KEEPS THE LAST.  IF
* THE EQUALS OPTION IS EVER REMOVED THE REPORT WILL SILENTLY
* START REPORTING THE FIRST ATTEMPT INSTEAD OF THE LAST.
 SORT FIELDS=(13,8,CH,A,21,3,CH,A)
 MODS E35=(CABSXLST,2048,SORTEXIT,N)
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=180
